- [Get started with SurrealDB Cloud](https://surrealdb.com/docs/build/deployment/surrealdb-cloud/getting-started): Cloud setup and management guide
- [Get started with JavaScript SDK](https://surrealdb.com/docs/languages/javascript/start): JavaScript SDK quick start
- [Get started with Python SDK](https://surrealdb.com/docs/languages/python/start): Python SDK quick start
