- [Get started with PHP SDK](https://surrealdb.com/docs/languages/php/setup): PHP SDK quick start

## SDKs

SurrealDB provides official client libraries for all major languages and runtimes. Each SDK supports connecting over WebSocket or HTTP, and some support embedded mode where SurrealDB runs directly inside the application process without a separate server.

- [JavaScript / TypeScript SDK](https://surrealdb.com/docs/languages/javascript/overview): Server-side and browser SDK for Node.js, Deno, and Bun
- [Python SDK](https://surrealdb.com/docs/languages/python): Async and sync Python client
- [Rust SDK](https://surrealdb.com/docs/languages/rust/overview): Native Rust client with embedded mode support
- [Go SDK](https://surrealdb.com/docs/languages/golang): Go client module
- [Java SDK](https://surrealdb.com/docs/languages/java): Maven and Gradle compatible Java client
- [.NET SDK](https://surrealdb.com/docs/languages/dotnet): NuGet package for .NET applications
- [PHP SDK](https://surrealdb.com/docs/languages/php/setup): Composer package for PHP applications
- [C SDK](https://github.com/surrealdb/surrealdb.c): C client library

